#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Insights" tvg-id="319320168" tvg-name="Faced with the perceived Russian threat on its border‚ in the Arctic‚ the Barents Sea and around the Svalbard archipelago‚ the Norwegian government has launched a massive rearmament programme‚ with the reinforcing of its NATO commitment‚ an investment in naval defence and a major increase in military presence the far north.<br/>From 05.12.2025 19:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Mapping the World - Norway: In Russia's Shadow (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.12.2025)
