#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Politics and society - Investigation and reports" tvg-id="1926106537" tvg-name="The island of Bougainville is to become independent from Papua New Guinea on 1 September 2027 and become the 194th nation in the world. This coming freedom is a source of excitement for local people colonised by Germany‚ then Australia before being merged into an independent Papua New Guinea in 1975. Can the resource-rich territory prosper on its own?<br/>From 23.10.2025 17:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",ARTE Reportage - Bougainville: A New Country (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.10.2025)
